{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24525","headline":"继之尚书自余病来寄遗非一又蒙览醉吟先生传题诗以美之今以此篇用伸酬谢 · 白居易","name":"继之尚书自余病来寄遗非一又蒙览醉吟先生传题诗以美之今以此篇用伸酬谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衰残与世日相疎，惠好唯君分有余。\n茶药赠多因病久，衣裳寄早及寒初。\n交情郑重金相似，诗韵清锵玉不如。\n醉傅狂言人尽笑，独知我者是尚书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}